  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2467244c7305ee14c91de3c98b7bb085, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialManager
  scriptLines:
  - sentence: 'This is your battle interface, where you will control the flow of
      the battle.

      From here, you will be able to defend against the enemy''s
      attacks while setting up our own counterattack.'
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    X: 0
    Y: 0
  - sentence: Stop Cutscene
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: StopCutscene
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 0
    Y: 0
  - sentence: 'Can you feel the beat? The enemy relies on chaotic transmissions,
      but we fight back using synchronization pulses. Try pressing the correct input
      keys to the rhythm. (Note: You can change input keys in the settings on the
      main menu.) '
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightarrows
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 0
    Y: -2.5
  - sentence: Stop Cutscene
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightstop
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: StopCutscene
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 0
    Y: 0
  - sentence: "Depending on how precise your timing is, the strength of your rhythm
      hit varies\u2014ranging from regular hits to clean 'Perfects' that deal direct
      damage to the enemy boss. However, any missed will cause you to take damage."
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightstop
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 0
    Y: -2.5
  - sentence: The bosses health is visualised using the red bar here. We'll win when
      the bar empties out.
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightboss
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 0
    Y: 3
  - sentence: Your health is visualised using the position of this red needle. If
      it reaches all the way to the left side, our base will fall.
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlighthealth
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 5
    Y: 1.7
  - sentence: 'At anytime, you can also hold down the Control Key and press the inputs
      to trigger COMBOs. (Note: You can change the control key and the input keys
      in the settings on the main menu.) '
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightstop
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 5
    Y: 0.2
  - sentence: 'Any inputs for the COMBO will be stored here. If there is a mistake
      for one of the inputs, you will have to fill in the remaining slots for it
      to reset. '
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightcurrent
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 5
    Y: 0.2
  - sentence: 'The COMBOs that you have access to will displayed here. Each COMBO
      will have a different effect, so you can experiment with them. '
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightavailable
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 5
    Y: -3.3
  - sentence: Stop Cutscene
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: StopCutscene
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightstop
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 0
    Y: 0
  - sentence: 'Depending on how precise you were on the timing of each note of the
      COMBO, its strength can vary. '
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    X: 5
    Y: 0.2
  - sentence: "Now that you\u2019ve triggered that COMBO, it enters a cooldown period.
      Trying to fully activate it before the cooldown finishes won't work, so timing
      is everything. "
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightavailable
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 5
    Y: -3.3
  - sentence: 'Great work. Look at that currency counter go up! Now you''ve got enough
      resources to deploy some automated backup. '
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightcurrency
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 0
    Y: 0
  - sentence: 'These are your defense turrets. Each has its own cost and combat style.
      Drag a turret from the shop panel and drop it directly onto a grid tile to
      purchase it. '
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightshop
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: -5
    Y: 3
  - sentence: Stop Cutscene
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: StopCutscene
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: highlightstop
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 0
    Y: 0
  - sentence: 'Remember, you can only place one turret per tile, so plan your layout
      carefully. Once placed, it will automatically target and fire at incoming threats
      until either the enemy breaks or the tower takes too much damage. '
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    X: 0
    Y: 0
  - sentence: "Nice shooting from the turret. But watch out\u2014if a minion slips
      past your defenses and reaches our base grid, it'll chunk our main health bar. "
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    X: 0
    Y: 0
  - sentence: 'Alright, rookie! That''s the core of it. Do you want to finish this
      boss off yourself, or do you need me to step in and save your skin? '
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
          m_MethodName: popup
          m_Mode: 1
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 0
          m_CallState: 2
    X: 0
    Y: 0
  - sentence: "Haha, fair enough. I\u2019ll finish this one off. Take a breather.
      I know it\u2019s a lot to process on day one! "
    onLineStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 4261663235650335007}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: TutorialManager, Assembly-CSharp
